property elements, count

on new me
  [  0] pusharglist 0 ........................... <[]>
  [  2] pushlist ................................ <[]>
  [  3] setprop 8 ............................... elements = []
  [  5] getparam 0 .............................. <me>
  [  7] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <me>
  [  9] extcall 9 ............................... return me
  [ 11] ret
end

on destroy me
  [  0] getprop 8 ............................... <elements>
  [  2] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <elements>
  [  4] objcall 10 .............................. elements.deleteAll()
  [  6] ret
end

on add me, s
  [  0] getprop 8 ............................... <elements>
  [  2] getparam 1 .............................. <s>
  [  4] pusharglist 2 ........................... <elements, s>
  [  6] objcall 11 .............................. <elements.getOne(s)>
  [  8] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  9] eq ...................................... <elements.getOne(s) = 0>
  [ 10] jmpifz [ 27] ............................ if elements.getOne(s) = 0 then
  [ 13] getprop 8 ............................... <elements>
  [ 15] getparam 1 .............................. <s>
  [ 17] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <elements, s>
  [ 19] objcall 6 ............................... elements.add(s)
  [ 21] getprop 8 ............................... <elements>
  [ 23] getobjprop 12 ........................... <elements.count>
  [ 25] setprop 12 .............................. count = elements.count
  [ 27] ret
end

on Remove me, s
  [  0] getprop 8 ............................... <elements>
  [  2] getparam 1 .............................. <s>
  [  4] pusharglist 2 ........................... <elements, s>
  [  6] objcall 14 .............................. <elements.deleteOne(s)>
  [  8] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <elements.deleteOne(s)>
  [ 10] extcall 9 ............................... return elements.deleteOne(s)
  [ 12] ret
end
